Cell["\<\
Drop singular values not exceeding 0.01 at every SVD step. This lets the \
algorithm reduce bond dimensions automatically while keeping the truncation \
error bounded:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->100000079,ExpressionUUID->"97b1caa1-0de6-4beb-843f-2962d3434dc7"],

