Cell["\<\
A long MPS with high bond dimension often compresses heavily because most \
singular values across each bond are small. Start from a six-site, bond-8 MPS:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->100000093,ExpressionUUID->"db8aaf45-a938-452f-83c1-1ed5c50ea977"],

